# A claim someone else pushed from another commit. The lease refuses it rather
# than fast-forwarding their claim onto our commit, and the ref is left where
# they put it.
run claim M1-01
exit 4
claims M1-01@elsewhere
after M1-01
file tasks/M1-01.md
	---
	id: M1-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive: no
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: M1-01 is already claimed
